&lt;p&gt;We value each person&#39;s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/strong&gt; culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
