&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the connective tissue for the London office, ensuring that engineers across Sim Realism, DUE, AIF, and other functions feel part of a single, cohesive &quot;One Waymo&quot; site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary executive conduit between Waymo&#39;s Foundation Model initiatives and Google DeepMind teams in the UK to accelerate joint R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical roadmap for the London Sim Realism team, driving tight alignment with Waymo&#39;s overarching simulation and AI-first objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct the research and engineering of cutting-edge generative models for sensor-level and semantic-level simulation (Waymo World Model).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, manage, and mentor a top-tier Sim Realism engineering organization, attracting elite talent in machine learning, generative AI, and simulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Real Estate &amp;amp; Workplace Services (REWS) to design and support a site strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A PhD or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Machine Learning, Robotics, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of leading, scaling, and managing large engineering organizations in a fast-paced, research-driven, and highly technical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep foundational knowledge and applied expertise in machine learning, generative foundation models, and/or complex simulation environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive complex, multi-year, cross-functional projects from early conception to global impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience managing and developing senior engineers, staff engineers, and technical leads/managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with autonomous vehicle technology, robotics, or complex embodied AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional executive communication skills, with a proven ability to build consensus and influence stakeholders across reporting lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated capability to translate highly ambiguous, long-term strategic goals into focused, actionable engineering roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level.&amp;nbsp; Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£230,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£242,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;AST SpaceMobile is building the first and only global cellular broadband network in space to operate directly with standard, unmodified mobile devices based on our extensive IP and patent portfolio and designed for both commercial and government applications. Our engineers and space scientists are on a mission to eliminate the connectivity gaps faced by today’s five billion mobile subscribers and finally bring broadband to the billions who remain unconnected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Position Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AST SpaceMobile and our global partners are building the first and only space-based cellular broadband network accessible by standard smartphones. Called SpaceMobile, this ultra-powerful network is being designed to provide connectivity at 4G/5G speeds everywhere on the planet—on land, at sea, and in flight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an Automation Engineer to lead, build, and create an automation infrastructure for our software. In this role, you will work closely with the engineering team to maintain high-quality products throughout their lifecycle while gaining hands-on experience with cloud technologies and complex system testing. This position offers the opportunity to play a key role in shaping the future of our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain automated tests for backend, UI, and API components to ensure comprehensive test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to integrate automated testing into CI/CD pipelines and ensure timely delivery of high-quality software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with development team members to identify test scenarios, perform manual testing, and automate them effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and debug automation code to ensure reliable test execution and accurate results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve test coverage, execution efficiency, and reliability through optimization of automation frameworks and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor team members on automation best practices and provide technical support as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and support a zero-bug approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Education&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equivalent experience may be considered, including IDF courses or equivalent bootcamp programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 7 years of automation testing experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in automating tests for backend, UI, and API layers using programming languages such as Java, C#, or Python, and frameworks such as Cucumber or other BDD frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams in Agile environments, preferably within CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring team members and providing technical guidance on automation best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerization technologies such as Docker or Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Linux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to troubleshoot issues in automated tests across different layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to effectively communicate technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to adapt to changing project requirements and technology stacks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous improvement mindset with a proactive approach to enhancing automation frameworks and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technology Stack&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C#&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cucumber and other BDD frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selenium&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cypress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Postman&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Physical Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a standard office environment and use a computer for extended periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;AST SpaceMobile is an Equal Opportunity, at will Employer; employment is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does an UK- New Business Director&amp;nbsp;do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The New Business Director plays a pivotal role in shaping and driving growth for WPP Production, &lt;strong&gt;defining how we win high-value, complex opportunities and shaping the strategic direction of our UK growth function&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the strategic direction and narrative for priority new business opportunities, &lt;strong&gt;designing integrated solutions and clear go-to-market propositions.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;You will ensure that every response (whether formal RFP or informal approach) is clearly positioned, commercially compelling and aligned to client needs. You will be accountable for the &lt;strong&gt;quality and consistency of our narrative and strategic output across all UK pitches&lt;/strong&gt;, setting the standard for how we articulate our value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with senior stakeholders across WPP Production and the wider WPP network, you will play a key role in &lt;strong&gt;driving integration across Media, Creative and Production&lt;/strong&gt;, shaping how we bring together capabilities to deliver differentiated client solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond individual opportunities, you will take a broader view of growth — &lt;strong&gt;defining where we should focus, how we prioritise opportunities, and how we scale success globally&lt;/strong&gt;. This includes evolving our approach to pitches, refining commercial models and embedding best practice ways of working across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role with visibility across the whole UK business, suited to someone who thrives in the fast-paced world of new business, operates with a high level of autonomy, and is motivated by driving measurable growth and business impact at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key areas of responsibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and lead the strategic direction for priority, high-value opportunities, ensuring a clear and differentiated approach to winning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the narrative quality and strategic standard across all pitches, setting the benchmark for how we articulate our value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end client solutions and commercial models, including operating models, pricing approach and value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of go-to-market propositions, continuously evolving how WPP Production positions itself in market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Global Chief Growth Officer to define and drive the global growth strategy for WPP Production, identifying priority markets, opportunity types and areas of focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and influence where we focus our growth efforts, ensuring time and resource are prioritised on the highest value opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse pipeline, performance and market trends to identify where growth is coming from — and where it should come from next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leadership to shape growth priorities, targets and investment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improved conversion, efficiency and revenue impact across the new business pipeline through stronger strategic positioning and approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale a repeatable growth engine, embedding frameworks, playbooks, tools and best practice that enable teams globally to win consistently without central dependency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a “pitch doctor”, stepping into critical opportunities to strengthen narrative, structure and overall response quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and represent WPP Production in senior client meetings &amp;amp; pitch meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-WPP integration, ensuring seamless collaboration across Media, Creative and Production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and embed new ways of working, improving how we approach, structure and deliver pitches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on innovation in growth, including exploring the use of AI and new technologies to enhance team capability and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with senior stakeholders across WPP and key client organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale team capability, through coaching, mentoring and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;What good looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in new business, client leadership, growth or strategy roles within a creative, production or agency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional strategic thinking, with a proven ability to define how complex opportunities are approached and won&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding writing and storytelling ability, with experience leading narrative development for high-value, multi-disciplinary pitches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen, with experience designing and influencing commercial models, pricing strategies and value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to use and apply AI tools to the new business process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading large, complex and high-value pitch processes, often involving multiple stakeholders and disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident and credible communicator, with experience presenting to senior clients and influencing at leadership level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating at pace and under pressure, managing multiple high-stakes opportunities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of integrated marketing ecosystems, including the intersection of media, creative and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to influence and align senior stakeholders, often with competing priorities, to a single direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping or evolving go-to-market propositions and strategic positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively in ambiguous, fast-paced environments, bringing structure and clarity to complex challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive and solutions-driven mindset, with a strong sense of ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and mentoring team members, with a focus on building capability and scaling impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and forward-thinking, with an interest in innovation, AI and the future of content and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-BS2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
